flowchart TB
accTitle: Private reachability needs transport and route exchange
accDescr: The application reaches on-premises dependencies using private addressing over a private virtual interface, with BGP between the customer router and AWS.
O[On-premises dependency<br/>Private IP]:::inputData --> R[Customer router<br/>VLAN + BGP with MD5]:::decision
R --> C[Dedicated Direct Connect path]:::inputData
C --> V[Private virtual interface]:::decision
V --> G[VPC gateway and routes]:::decision
G --> A[Private EC2 application]:::output
N[No instance Elastic IP required]:::warning -. private addressing .-> A
